flowchart TD
 A[Identify service requirements] --> B[Confirm instrument, contract and SoCP]
 B --> C[Prepare individual draft job plan]
 C --> D[Consult medical officer and Clinical Director]
 D --> E{Agreement reached?}
 E -- No --> F[Record differences and seek resolution]
 F --> D
 E -- Yes --> G[Validate hours, CST, fatigue and resources]
 G --> H{Compliant and feasible?}
 H -- No --> C
 H -- Yes --> I[Authorised delegate approves]
 I --> J[Implement plan and align roster]
 J --> K[Monitor planned versus delivered activity]
 K --> L[Review on schedule or material change]
 L --> C
